>\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\">\u003Cspan data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Ἀγαθή\">Ἀγαθη\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"χαῖρε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"χαίρω\">χ[αῖρε]\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">[ἔ]ζησεν\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">[ἔτη\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Victoria Fendel, Robert Crellin\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Cspan data-text=\"Θεοις\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Θεός\">Θεοις\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"χθονίοις\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"χθόνιος\">χθονίοις\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Ἀγαθή\">Ἀγαθη\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"χαῖρε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"χαίρω\">χαῖρε\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">ἔζησεν\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ἔτη\u003C/span> [\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alessandra Rocchetti\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"Θεοις\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Θεός\">[..]ΟΙΣ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"χθονίοις\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"χθόνιος\">ΧΘΟ[.....]\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\">\u003Cspan data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Ἀγαθή\">ΑΓΑΘΗ\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"χαῖρε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"χαίρω\">Χ[....]\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">[.]ΖΗΣΕΝ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">[...\u003C/span>\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Victoria Fendel, Robert Crellin\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan data-text=\"Θεοις\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Θεός\">ΘΕΟΙΣ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"χθονίοις\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"χθόνιος\">ΧΘΟΝΙΟΙΣ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Ἀγαθή\">ΑΓΑΘΗ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"χαῖρε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"χαίρω\">ΧΑΙΡΕ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">ΕΖΗΣΕΝ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ΕΤΗ\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cp>  \u003Cspan class=\"line 1\">line.1: \u003Cspan>[Θε]οῖς Χθο[νίοις] Franz (ap. CIG III 5732c); Kaibel (ap. IG XIV 457)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr>  \u003Cspan class=\"line 2\">line.2: \u003Cspan>Ἀγάθη χ[αῖρε] Kaibel (ap. IG XIV 457); ἡ δεῖνα ἀ]γάθη Franz (ap. CIG III 5732c)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr>  \u003Cspan class=\"line 3\">line.3: \u003Cspan>[ἔ]ζησεν [ἔτη ---] Franz (ap. CIG III 5732c); Kaibel (ap. IG XIV 457)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003C/p>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>To the Gods of the Underworld. Agathe, farewell! She lived for … years.\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>This epitaph is dedicated to a deceased female, Agathe, and preceeded by an invocation to the Gods of the Underworld, in a less usual form than the more typical \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Θεοῖς Καταχθονίοις\u003C/span> (cf. IG XIV 30 = \u003Ca href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000847\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000847\u003C/a>, IG XIV 49 = \u003Ca href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000866\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000866\u003C/a>, both from Siracusa). The unabbreviated form is found before the Augustan age, but occasionally also after: this seems to be the case, if at l. 2 we read the name Agathe (and not an adjective referred to the deceased, with the name in the lacuna, as Franz ap. CIG III 5732c). \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Ἀγάθη\u003C/span> is a name which recurs in Catania in several palaeochristian epitaphs: IG XIV 523 (= \u003Ca href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic001343\" target=\"_blank\">ISic001343\u003C/a>), IG XIV 524 (= \u003Ca href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic001334\" target=\"_blank\">ISic001344\u003C/a>), IG XIV 525 (= \u003Ca href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000964\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000964\u003C/a>), IG XIV 552 (\u003Ca href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic001371\" target=\"_blank\">ISic001371\u003C/a>). The age, expressed in numerals, is lost in the final lacuna. \u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Franz 1853 5732c \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001250\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001250\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Kaibel 1890 \u003Ca href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">457\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence \u003C/div>",[189,192,195,198,201,204],{"id":190,"html":191},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alessandra Rocchetti\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"Θεοις\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Θεός\">[Θε]οις\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"χθονίοις\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"χθόνιος\">χθο[νίοις]\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\">\u003Cspan data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Ἀγαθή\">Ἀγαθη\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"χαῖρε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"χαίρω\">χ[αῖρε]\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">[ἔ]ζησεν\u003C/span>  \u00